<title>UK: ABN Amro Hoare Govett chief joins LSE board.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro Hoare Govett chief joins LSE board.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Peter Meinertzhagen, the chairman of ABN Amro Hoare Govett Ltd and Hoare Govett Corporate Finance Ltd, was appointed to its board.</p>
<p>The exchange also said that Richard Barfield and Masashi Kaneko would not be seeking reappointment to the board at its July's annual meeting.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
